<h1 data-copy-en="Zosia" data-copy-zh="Zosia">Zosia</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Zosia’s complete tutoring route, heart-to-hearts, dates, private visit and Propaganda lesson." data-copy-zh="Zosia的完整导师路线、谈心、约会、私人拜访与宣传教学。">Zosia’s complete tutoring route, heart-to-hearts, dates, private visit and Propaganda lesson.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Zosia</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Institute_Training_and_Lessons"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Zosia — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zosia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Zosia — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zosia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Zosia — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Zosia has a full personal route at the Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute, separate from the institute’s public stat lessons. It includes conversation, books, three heart-to-hearts, two dates and a later repeatable private hour.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview_and_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find Zosia</h2><p>Go to Future → Fringe Zone → Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute, daily 09:00–19:00. Most personal milestones are visits to this institute; the two dates are selected from her portrait and travel onward as part of the encounter.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Follow the automatic institute milestones below. A Question of Standards requires Friend (100), the circular-reasoning milestone and an 11:00–15:00 start. An Appalling Performance follows at Crush (400), after the examination milestone and the first heart-to-heart, 16:00–18:00.</p><p>Avoiding Doubt requires Intimate (1600), the interest milestone and the second heart-to-heart, 17:00–18:00. The subsequent personal scenes open her private hour. High affection does not replace those completed milestones.</p><p>Neon Bazaar Date is available at Friend (100), 18:00–19:00; Skygarden Date at Crush (400), 11:00–16:00. Each completes once and can be pursued when its own conditions are met.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Read the Question</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zosia Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Full Marks, Wrong Century</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zosia Known (25); after Read the Question</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Chemistry Has Rhythm</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zosia Acquaintance (50); after Full Marks, Wrong Century</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Circular Reasoning</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zosia Friend (100); after Chemistry Has Rhythm</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Printed Matter</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zosia Close Friend (200); after Circular Reasoning</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">In My Handwriting</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zosia Close Friend (200); after Printed Matter</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Examination That Failed</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zosia Close Friend (200); after In My Handwriting</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Question of Interest</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zosia Romantic (800); after The Examination That Failed / An Appalling Performance</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Honest Distraction</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zosia Intimate (1600); after A Question of Interest / For the Avoidance of Doubt</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Reserved for You</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Zosia In Love (3000); after An Honest Distraction</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Zosia +10</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">A Question of Standards</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 11:00–15:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Circular Reasoning</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Appalling Performance</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after The Examination That Failed / A Question of Standards</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Avoiding Doubt</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 17:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Intimate (1600); after A Question of Interest / An Appalling Performance</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −15 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Neon Bazaar Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 18:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $80; −25 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Skygarden Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −25 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk takes 15 minutes and gives 1 actual base point, four safe uses daily. Give Book opens at Known (25), takes 10 minutes and one Book, and gives 8 base points twice daily. Source Criticism follows the examination milestone at Close Friend (200): 30 minutes, Perception +1 and 8 direct relationship points, once.</p><p>Each personal heart-to-heart costs 60 minutes and 15 Energy. Neon Bazaar costs 120 minutes, $80 and 25 Energy; Skygarden costs 120 minutes, $100 and 25 Energy.</p><p>Private Time starts at the institute 17:00–18:00, requiring Intimate, the later distraction milestone, Avoiding Doubt and the corresponding content access. A completed visit gives 50 base relationship points. It takes 60 minutes and 30 Energy, once daily; a visit started before closing remains valid through its ending.</p><p>At In Love (3000), after the examination, Reserved for You and Avoiding Doubt, A Claim Worth Repeating grants Propaganda +1 once per run. It is a zero-minute personal action at the institute, 09:00–19:00, separate from buying ordinary army upgrades.</p><p>Relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers affect the final gain. Repeated actions keep their daily allowance when you meet the same character elsewhere.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Intelligence 70 / Technology 65 / Perception 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Researching</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 4 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Book</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">10 min; Book ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +8; 2 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Source Criticism</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after The Examination That Failed</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Perception +1; direct relationship +8; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Private Time</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 17:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Intimate (1600); after An Honest Distraction / For the Avoidance of Doubt; corresponding content access</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">60 min; −30 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">1 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Claim Worth Repeating</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Universal Knowledge Synthesis Institute; 09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">In Love (3000); relationship 3000; after The Examination That Failed / Reserved for You / For the Avoidance of Doubt</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">0 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Propaganda +1; once per run</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Heart-to-heart reward reference</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Conversation</th><th scope="col">Best ordinary base total</th><th scope="col">Useful special replies</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">A Question of Standards</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">87</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Appalling Performance</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">94</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">For the Avoidance of Doubt</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">106</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>These totals describe the best ordinary choices, before relationship modifiers. A special reply can improve the reward; it is not required just to finish the conversation. Romantic adds 25 final relationship points on completion.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>The institute’s public lessons do not substitute for Zosia’s personal events or award their relationship progress. For a missing private hour, check the 17:00–18:00 start, Avoiding Doubt, the distraction milestone and today’s use.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense</a> · <a href="skills.html">Skills</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Institute_Training_and_Lessons"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Zosia 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zosia.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Zosia 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/zosia.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Zosia 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Zosia在通用知识综合研究所拥有完整个人路线，与研究所面向玩家的属性教学分开。内容包括交谈、书本、三段谈心、两项约会，以及后续可重复的私人一小时。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview_and_Schedule"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>前往未来 → 边缘区 → 通用知识综合研究所，每天09:00—19:00。多数个人里程碑在这里拜访触发，两项约会也从她的头像选择，再随事件前往目的地。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">通用知识综合研究所</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先按下表推进研究所自动里程碑。标准之问要求朋友（100）、完成循环论证事件，并在11:00—15:00开始。糟糕的表演接在考试里程碑和第一段谈心之后，要求迷恋（400），16:00—18:00开始。</p><p>为免误会要求亲密（1600）、兴趣里程碑和第二段谈心，17:00—18:00开始。接续的个人事件会开放私人一小时，高好感不能代替这些前置完成记录。</p><p>霓虹集市约会要求朋友（100），18:00—19:00开始；空中花园约会要求迷恋（400），11:00—16:00开始。各只能完成一次，满足各自条件后即可安排。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">请先读题</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zosia 陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">满分，错了六百年</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zosia 已知（25）；完成：请先读题</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">化学也有节奏</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zosia 相识（50）；完成：满分，错了六百年</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">循环论证</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zosia 朋友（100）；完成：化学也有节奏</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">纸上有据</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zosia 亲密朋友（200）；完成：循环论证</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">是我的笔迹</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zosia 亲密朋友（200）；完成：纸上有据</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不及格的考试</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zosia 亲密朋友（200）；完成：是我的笔迹</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">心之所向</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">通用知识综合研究所; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zosia 浪漫感（800）；完成：不及格的考试、糟糕的表演</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">心甘情愿的分心</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">通用知识综合研究所; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zosia 亲密（1600）；完成：心之所向、为免误会</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zosia +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">为你预留</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">通用知识综合研究所; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Zosia 恋爱中（3000）；完成：心甘情愿的分心</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Zosia +10</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">标准之问</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">通用知识综合研究所; 11:00–15:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：循环论证</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−15 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">糟糕的表演</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">通用知识综合研究所; 16:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：不及格的考试、标准之问</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−15 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">为免误会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">通用知识综合研究所; 17:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密（1600）；完成：心之所向、糟糕的表演</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−15 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">霓虹集市约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">通用知识综合研究所; 18:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富80；−25 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">空中花园约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">通用知识综合研究所; 11:00–16:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富100；−25 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈消耗15分钟，实际给予1点基础关系，每日安全额度4次。已知（25）开放送书，消耗10分钟及一本书，获得8点基础关系，每日2次。资料考辨接在考试里程碑后，要求亲密朋友（200），花30分钟，一次性增加感知1点和8点直接关系。</p><p>三段个人谈心各消耗60分钟、15精力。霓虹集市约会消耗120分钟、80财富、25精力；空中花园约会消耗120分钟、100财富、25精力。</p><p>私密时光从研究所17:00—18:00发起，要求亲密、后期分心里程碑、为免误会及相应内容访问权限，完整拜访给予50点基础关系，消耗60分钟、30精力，每日一次。在开放时段内开始，即使结束时已过闭馆时间也有效。</p><p>恋爱中（3000）并完成考试、为你预留与为免误会后，值得传开的主张每轮可一次性给予宣传+1。这是研究所09:00—19:00的零分钟个人动作，与普通军队升级购买分开。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量受共通关系修正影响。同一角色换地点不会重置重复动作的每日额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">智力 70、科技 65、感知 60</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">研究</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；4次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">赠书</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">10分钟；书 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+8；每日安全额度2次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">资料考辨</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：不及格的考试</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">感知 +1；直接关系+8；一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">私密时光</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">通用知识综合研究所; 17:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密（1600）；完成：心甘情愿的分心、为免误会；相应内容访问权限</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">60分钟；−30 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">1次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">值得传开的主张</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">通用知识综合研究所; 09:00–19:00</td><td data-label="条件">恋爱中（3000）；关系点数3000；完成：不及格的考试、为你预留、为免误会</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">0分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">宣传+1；每轮一次</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>展开谈心奖励参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">最佳普通选择基础总值</th><th scope="col">实用特殊回复条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">标准之问</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">87</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">糟糕的表演</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">94</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">为免误会</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">106</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>总值为普通选项的最佳基础合计，尚未套用关系修正。特殊回复可提高奖励，但不是完成谈心的必要条件；学会浪漫后，完成时另加25点最终关系。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>研究所的公共教学不能代替Zosia个人事件，也不提供这些事件的关系进展。缺少私人一小时，请检查17:00—18:00开始时段、为免误会、分心里程碑和当天使用次数。</p></section>
